Read cabinet controls from a launcher input block (WANGAN_INPUT_BLOCK)

Against vixen256/WanganArcadeLoader0.5 d3fc426. GPL-3.0, like WAL.
When WANGAN_INPUT_BLOCK=<path> is set, jamma handle_events reads wheel,
pedals, gear, view, intrude, test, service and card insert from the
64-byte "WIO1" block instead of SDL/keyboard; unset, nothing changes.

